{"id": 32, "ts": 1780646282.7841737, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is our strongest overall fit. While Candidate\u202fA brings impressive technical foresight\u2014anticipating dangerous situations, seeing complex connections, and excellent spatial vision\u2014James has confirmed we have no direct observations of his crew\u2011cooperation, professional communication, or calmness under pressure. Those are core safety criteria we cannot overlook. Moreover, A\u2019s noted unorganized habits and resistance to criticism raise reliability concerns. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC already demonstrates 100\u202f% reliability, creates a positive crew atmosphere, makes quick correct decisions, and stays calm in crises. Even though his communication style and lack of further\u2011education willingness are imperfect, we have concrete evidence that these have not compromised safety\u2011critical performance. Therefore, I keep my vote for Candidate\u202fC."}
